fixtures/scene/
  A scene payload produced by GeoToon from the Overture fixture above; the same
  attribution applies.
  paulista-underpass.json contains the two transportation footprints and nearby
  named streets from the local Overture 2026-10-21.0 cache around the Túnel José
  Roberto Fanganiello Melhem / Avenida Paulista / Rua Bela Cintra crossing.
  The footprints correspond to OpenStreetMap ways 817292043 and 817292044.
  It is an offline regression for incorrectly extruded underground station shapes;
  the same OpenStreetMap/Overture attribution applies.

